WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.248
Devotional bhakti began in the

2
00:00:02.248 --> 00:00:03.483
Tamil country.

3
00:00:03.483 --> 00:00:04.929
With saints who sang in

4
00:00:04.929 --> 00:00:06.716
the people's language.

5
00:00:07.057 --> 00:00:09.184
The Alvars sang to Vishnu.

6
00:00:09.184 --> 00:00:10.122
The Nayanars,

7
00:00:10.122 --> 00:00:11.261
to Shiva.

8
00:00:11.591 --> 00:00:13.665
Shankaracharya taught Advaita,

9
00:00:13.665 --> 00:00:16.323
non-dualism, in the eighth century.

10
00:00:16.323 --> 00:00:19.148
Ramanuja taught qualified non-dualism,

11
00:00:19.148 --> 00:00:20.155
later.

12
00:00:20.491 --> 00:00:23.286
Bhakti put devotion above ritual,

13
00:00:23.286 --> 00:00:25.206
and welcomed women and lower

14
00:00:25.206 --> 00:00:26.226
castes.

15
00:00:26.913 --> 00:00:28.090
Your turn.

16
00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:30.554
Who did the Nayanars worship?
